@startuml Sequence_Diagram_Update_Status_Pesanan
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Update Status Pesanan

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Halaman Detail Pesanan" as UI
participant "Sistem" as System
database "Database" as DB
participant "Sistem Notifikasi" as NotificationSystem

Admin -> UI: Akses halaman detail pesanan
activate UI

UI -> System: requestDetailPesanan(orderId)
activate System

System -> DB: fetchDetailPesanan(orderId)
activate DB
DB --> System: detailPesanan
deactivate DB

System --> UI: detailPesanan
deactivate System

UI -> Admin: Tampilkan detail pesanan dan form update status

Admin -> UI: Pilih status baru dan isi catatan

UI -> System: submitUpdateStatus(orderId, newStatus, catatan)
activate System

System -> System: validasiData(newStatus, catatan)

alt Data Valid
    System -> DB: updateOrderStatus(orderId, newStatus, catatan)
    activate DB
    DB --> System: statusUpdateSuccess
    deactivate DB

    System -> NotificationSystem: kirimNotifikasi(orderId, newStatus)
    activate NotificationSystem
    NotificationSystem --> System: notifikasiTerkirim
    deactivate NotificationSystem

    System --> UI: updateBerhasil
    UI -> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi sukses
else Data Tidak Valid
    System --> UI: updateGagal(errors)
    UI -> Admin: Tampilkan pesan error
end

deactivate System
deactivate UI

@enduml